<item>
  <title>Iara Coimbra and Beatriz Oliveira start independent undergraduate projects</title>
  <link>https://provetelab.org/news/2025-09-15-iara-beatriz/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>Iara Coimbra has joined Beatriz Oliveira to conduct their independent undergraduate research projects. <strong>Both had their fellowships approved.</strong> Congratulations!</p>



 ]]></description>
