<item>
  <title>Bruna Maria joins the lab as a Master’s student</title>
  <link>https://provetelab.org/news/2025-02-15-bruna-master/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>Bruna Maria has joined the lab as a <strong>Master’s student</strong>. She’ll be testing how multiple biodiversity facets of frogs respond to urbanisation in the Brazilian Atlantic Forest, using a macroecological approach.</p>



 ]]></description>
  <category>news</category>
  <category>people</category>
  <guid>https://provetelab.org/news/2025-02-15-bruna-master/</guid>
  <pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
  <title>Diogo awarded a FUNDECT research productivity grant</title>
  <link>https://provetelab.org/news/2024-10-01-fundect-grant/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>Diogo has been granted a <strong>FUNDECT research productivity grant</strong>. This small grant will allow us to keep funding field work conducted by our students.</p>



 ]]></description>
  <category>news</category>
  <category>funding</category>
  <guid>https://provetelab.org/news/2024-10-01-fundect-grant/</guid>
  <pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
  <title>Welcome to Ana Paula Andreazzi</title>
  <link>https://provetelab.org/news/2024-07-15-ana-paula-joins/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>We gave a warm welcome to <strong>Ana Paula Andreazzi</strong>, who joins the lab as a PhD student. Ana Paula will be testing how <strong>stingless bees respond to heat waves in urban ecosystems</strong> in the Tropics.</p>



 ]]></description>
  <category>news</category>
  <category>people</category>
  <guid>https://provetelab.org/news/2024-07-15-ana-paula-joins/</guid>
  <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jul 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
</item>
